# Wolfbat (2/2 flier): "Whenever you draw your second card each turn, you may pay {B}. If you do, return this card from your
# graveyard to the battlefield with a finality counter on it." Bot1 bolts its own Wolfbat on turn 1. On turn 3 the draw step is
# the first card; Ancestral Recall draws three, the second of which triggers the Wolfbat once (not again for the third). With only
# the Mox Ruby's {R} in the pool the payment is refused (it is {B}, not {1}); Bot1 taps Mox Jet, pays {B} and the {R} is left. The
# Wolfbat returns with a finality counter. Bot2 then bolts it again on turn 4:
# a creature with a finality counter that would die is exiled instead (CR 122.1h).

